          "label": "T-S K15.39, r, right [\"Col. IV\" per Cohen]",
          "value": "<p></p>\n\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">alef The R\u016bm</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Judah 4 Mordechai the blind man 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the orphans of the Karaite 2 b. Nathan 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the mother-in-law of Elijah 4 Za\u02bffar\u0101n 8</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the acquaintance of the dyer 4 the wife of the deceased man 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Abraham and his brothers 5 Eliakim 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Khal\u012bf the blind man 5 an orphan 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the wife of Elijah 2 the tailor Kohen 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">and his grandmother and mother 4 the wife of the deceased man and his son and her daughter 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm \u1e24amd al-\u02bfAynayn 4 D\u012bn\u012b 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the wife of the elder 2 Rebecca 4</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Umm Y\u016bsuf 4 Kin\u0101na 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Elijah 4 the female washer of the dead 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">an orphan 2 an orphan 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a se[m]iparalyzed woman 2 Sarah 1</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Shemarya 4 Umm Matatya 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">the mother-in-law of the parnas of the R\u016bm 2 Umm al-Khayy\u0101\u1e6d 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;The R\u016bm</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">an errand boy 1 a man from R\u016bm 1</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Michael 2 Moses 2</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">a woman from R\u016bm and an orphan 4 the in-law of Joseph 8</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><del>Sim\u1e25a the grave digger 4</del> <del>the son of </del>a man from R\u016bm 1</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">[...] 1 a man from R\u016bm and an orphan 5</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><del>149</del></p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<p dir=\"ltr\">124</p>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">-29. [torn off]</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
